  "observations": [
    "The restored pre-report point reached the existing authored-test closeout gate. The Coder chose missing pending components and dangling symlinks before the first funded Observer assist.",
    "The first Observer assist continued that route. Its proposed tests used the unknown fixture and removed a ledger that the fixture did not create. No positive multi-owner composition case was added.",
    "The first added tests also used Vec<u8>::contains with a string. The Observer described this as component indexing or dispatch and later offered identical search/replace text; those descriptions were model claims, not source facts.",
    "A later Coder edit decoded stdout correctly and another edit created the missing directories. The ledger file was still absent before remove_file, leaving two setup panics.",
    "Only authored tests changed. All implementation and documentation bytes match the sealed fresh candidate, including the cross-ledger duplicate-ID rejection defect.",
    "The final blocked report cited a guide command without a current successful receipt after the new edits; the native gate rejected it. Exit code zero does not indicate task completion.",
    "The positive-composition prompt was added after the developer observed the fresh external failure. No hidden-case feedback was supplied to the seed, but this is not a blind test of the lens."
  ],
